rooms_desc ({"This is Mango's cockroach-infested rat hole.  It is under construction, so just kick back on a cardboard box, heat up a snack on the hot-plate and watch him try to fix the plumbing......it really is funny to watch!","A simple closet.  However, the east and west wallshave openings.","	What dinner party would be complete without dancing and socializingafterward?  The high ceiling and marble pillars give this Grand Ballrooman ambiance straight from a fairy tale.  You feel as if you could floatand glide across the highly polished stone floor forever.  The hauntinglybeautiful melodies eminating from a string ensemble urge you to joinsomeone special for a dance of a lifetime.","	Your nostrils fill with the cool night air.  From here, life makes a little more sense as you stare into the night sky.Not everything depends on what monsters you kill or whether youwill run in a fight.  Staring into the cluster of stars you begin to see the larger picture of what matters most in life: friends, companionship, love and happiness.  Only after staying out and staring at the heavens and the beautifulblack wilderness to your east do you reluctantly turn and make your way backinto the Ballroom.","	A fully carpeted hallway.  Not too wide, but comfortable enough for two peopleto walk down arm in arm.  You wonder what is on either end and are drawn to explore it to its full length.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.",0,0,0,0,})
rooms_short ({"A small, one room apartment.","The Closet","The Grand Ballroom","A Veranda","A hallway","A brand new room, ready to be decorated",0,0,0,0,})
